    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 0eb87801ab253176b9c1554c23014b5b616ff408 -->\n**Review (M3): ready to merge. This fixes the red batch gate on main (#1374).**\n- `sinker_rough_finish_pair.cl` is split into `_rough.cl` and `_finish.cl`, one CL stream per file. Concatenating the two new files gives exactly the bytes of the old golden (checked with `cmp`), so no recorded value moved.\n- `sinker_undersize` writes each stream to its own golden. The sim assertions are unchanged.\n- Local results: `sinker_undersize` 7 and `camcraft-cl headless_bin` 3 pass. The latter includes `cl_text_round_trips_every_golden`, which failed on main.\n- The change is test-only, with no product code.",
